sw/test/ - cgra CLI unit tests
==============================

    test_sw.c   assert.h unit tests for the DSL parser (dsl.c) and the mode
                compiler + engines (compile.c). Covers section/directive
                parsing, $variable expansion, parse-error rejection, the
                built-in defaults, diagonal mode_compile + cfg_decode, and the
                matvec/scan/conv engines vs. a host reference (run against the
                sim: emulator, so no FPGA).

TAP-style output; non-zero exit on failure.

Run (make -f ../sw.mk <target>)
-------------------------------
    unit                 build + run the unit tests
    smoke                CLI smoke tests against the emulator
    test                 unit + smoke
    PROFILE=asan test    same, under AddressSanitizer + UBSan
    valgrind             unit tests under valgrind

Compiled -UNDEBUG so assert() fires in any PROFILE.
